    "공유에서 나왔어요. 지금까지 받은 일정은 그대로 남아 있어요.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’ve left sharing. Events you’ve received so far stay as they are."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’ve left sharing. Events you’ve received so far stay as they are."
          }
