    "움직임 줄이기를 켜면 화면 효과가 차분해져요.": {
      "comment": "Roadmap item detail: respect Reduce Motion",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With Reduce Motion on, screen effects calm down."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With Reduce Motion on, screen effects calm down."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con Reducir movimiento activado, los efectos de pantalla son más sutiles."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「視差効果を減らす」をオンにすると、画面の動きが控えめになります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
